---
// Front-door nameplate: the imprint across the full page, the standing line beneath it,
// and a thick-and-thin rule closing the head, as a periodical's front page is set.
// Placed in Periodical's "masthead" slot so it spans all twelve columns.
---

<header class="masthead">
  <h1 class="masthead-name small-caps">As We May Act</h1>
  <p class="masthead-line">Public records in Arkansas, and what to do with them.</p>
</header>

<style>
  .masthead {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Thick over thin, 3px apart: the one place the heavier rule pair appears. */
  .masthead::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    height: 6px;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .masthead-name {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-grotesque);
    font-weight: 700;
    /* Display step at full width; scales down on a phone so the name keeps one line. */
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 10.5vw, var(--step-4));
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .masthead-line {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-text);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--ink-light);
  }
</style>
